  "title": "Spotify and Kobalt Announce Licensing Agreement for Fan-Made Covers and Remixes",
  "summary": "Spotify and Kobalt, the world’s largest independent music publisher, today announced a licensing agreement for Spotify’s upcoming tool that will allow fans to create covers and remixes of their favorite songs from participating songwriters. As previously announced, this new tool will introduce a creation model where songwriters and artists can directly share in the value...",
